{"id":"wb-7-629","name":"骑龙岗古墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"骑龙岗古墓群","text":"骑龙岗古墓群是位于慈利县零阳镇石板村的一处战国至汉代墓葬群，包括千余座古墓。1987年、2003年两度发掘，出土了陶器、青铜器、漆木器、竹简等等。墓葬多为深葬，超过3米。出土4000多枚竹简。其中36号大墓为覆斗直壁、青灰土填土，出土楚简千余枚。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AA%91%E9%BE%99%E5%B2%97%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86785833,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785833","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/47b2b9418282cdbf6b55dc61.jpg","title":"向南看_20240224.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%90%91%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%8B_20240224.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/%E5%90%91%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%8B_20240224.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​从文保碑向南看 （古墓群南区和北区的南部）","width":320,"height":213}}